WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.454
Now put it all together, with a small project about a real problem near you.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.773
Choose a small, real problem in your community, school or work.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:14.178
Ask AI for ideas, and give it context about where you are.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:18.193
Check the ideas with facts and with people who know the area.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:22.517
Then submit your prompts, what you checked, and your final plan.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:33.343
Before you move on, check: Choose a real local problem. Record your prompts and the AI's answers. Write what you checked and changed. Submit your plan.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:39.477
Well done. You have finished the course. Now use AI on a real local problem.
